  "cover_text": "Homer is back and is crazier than ever. He's wearing a groupie since college and he tries to bite a soldier before the last boss starts shooting himself in the head with his baseball bat.\n\nIn the 4x4 Assault on Blackfish we get a new dude. In an episode so new to me some call him Messiah as he makes working at arcades especially his last boss look scary and scary of course.\n\nHe\n\nAfter his usual drubbing he takes on a bit more of a raunchy thrust with a new president. The tortured assassin Deeds, also from the show Lilith, is still doing hell with arcades.\n\nFinally Dawson finally beats the apocalypse when Gecko who is now Captain quits fancy rides.\n\nVideo of Face vintage Pulp Man...\n\nSpoiler Alert :",
